{"2749590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alternis", "steam_appid": 2749590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749590/extras/fdcfd04eaee82597a4a79e1acf48b708.poster.avif?t=1785286168\" width=560 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749590/extras/fdcfd04eaee82597a4a79e1acf48b708.webm?t=1785286168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749590/extras/fdcfd04eaee82597a4a79e1acf48b708.mp4?t=1785286168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>«Awaken... rise and command the flame of chaos.»</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Steel, gunpowder and magic.</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in fast-paced multiplayer battles where every move matters. Strike with a sword, fire your revolver, loose arrows from afar, or unleash flames upon your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no shortcuts—only skill, timing, and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt, outplay, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Features</strong></i></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based melee, ranged, and magic combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer PvP encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid movement and responsive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic fights driven by player decisions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Development</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternis is ac